00:11:57.008 --> 00:11:59.510
"Progress Toward Mob's Explosion: 31%"

00:12:07.644 --> 00:12:09.979
The atmosphere in here has transformed.

00:12:10.188 --> 00:12:12.523
The Yokai must be behind this.

00:12:12.732 --> 00:12:17.278
Curse you, Hundred Demons. They must
be plotting to make this their lair.

00:12:17.487 --> 00:12:19.489
Are there really Yokai here?

00:12:19.697 --> 00:12:23.785
Was this guy not just some cosplayer?

00:12:25.286 --> 00:12:27.330
The roots of some plant?

00:12:37.465 --> 00:12:40.927
What's wrong, Amakusa?
You're sweating bullets.

00:12:42.262 --> 00:12:43.680
Well, you see...

00:12:43.888 --> 00:12:48.726
I only have experience
fighting Yokai one-on-one.

00:12:48.935 --> 00:12:51.646
And every time,
it's a life-or-death situation.

00:12:51.854 --> 00:12:55.942
Even against solo Yokai, I made sure
to prepare as much as possible,

00:12:56.150 --> 00:13:00.446
and was able to slay them...
after three days and three nights.

00:13:00.655 --> 00:13:02.240
But this time...

00:13:02.448 --> 00:13:07.745
...we are in the lair of the Hundred Demons
Yokai horde, which means...

00:13:07.954 --> 00:13:08.830
What's wrong?!

00:13:09.038 --> 00:13:12.875
This wall's all slimy!

00:13:13.084 --> 00:13:16.212
Maybe if we hang some konjac up,
it'll scare people!

00:13:16.421 --> 00:13:17.880
--Wha--?!
--What's wrong?!

00:13:18.089 --> 00:13:20.133
The path we came from is--

00:13:20.341 --> 00:13:21.759
It's been closed off.

00:13:21.968 --> 00:13:25.680
I guess we'll have to take down
whatever's messing up this area.

00:13:25.888 --> 00:13:27.765
You seem calm about this, Serizawa.

00:13:27.974 --> 00:13:31.394
Oh, I tend to feel more relaxed
in dark, confined spaces.

00:13:31.602 --> 00:13:33.771
We can use cardboard and duct tape...

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.690
We'll have to measure the height
of the people playing the ghosts.

00:13:35.898 --> 00:13:38.318
Anyway, we'll just have
to keep moving forward.

00:13:38.526 --> 00:13:41.863
Hope you're prepared, Yokai hunter.

00:13:42.822 --> 00:13:45.533
My stomach feels all stabby...

00:13:56.002 --> 00:13:57.712
Reigen, behind you!

00:14:00.006 --> 00:14:02.342
So you've shown yourself, Yokai!

00:14:03.593 --> 00:14:08.389
Something or other, something
or other, O some kind of spirit!

00:14:08.931 --> 00:14:09.557
"Holy Blade Kusanagi-no-Dai-Hannya-Kagemitsu"
"(Tax Included)"

00:14:09.557 --> 00:14:11.309
"Holy Blade Kusanagi-no-Dai-Hannya-Kagemitsu"
"(Tax Included)" Give me strength!

00:14:11.309 --> 00:14:11.809
Give me strength!

00:14:11.893 --> 00:14:12.685
"Holy Blade!
Kusanagi-no-Dai-Hannya-Kagemitsu”

00:14:12.685 --> 00:14:17.648
"Holy Blade! Kusanagi-no-Dai-Hannya-Kagemitsu"
Holy Blade! Kusanagi-no-Dai-Hannya-Kagemitsu!

00:14:17.648 --> 00:14:17.940
Holy Blade!
Kusanagi-no-Dai-Hannya-Kagemitsu!

00:14:21.694 --> 00:14:24.530
My holy blade!

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:34.999
Ah... so it's basically
like a normal exorcism.

00:14:35.208 --> 00:14:38.419
What on Earth is that power?

00:14:38.628 --> 00:14:40.171
Now there're tons of them!

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:41.506
They're all coming at once!

00:14:41.714 --> 00:14:45.259
We're in so much danger that my
brain has stopped functioning...

00:14:45.468 --> 00:14:47.804
I'm going to use salt to weaken them.

00:14:48.012 --> 00:14:50.723
The rest is up to you, Serizawa and Mob!

00:14:50.932 --> 00:14:52.475
Yes, sir!

00:14:52.683 --> 00:14:53.935
Take this!

00:14:54.143 --> 00:14:56.479
Salt Splash!

00:14:56.687 --> 00:15:01.025
Oh, maybe we could use
purified salt for something fun.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:05.071
I see...

00:15:05.279 --> 00:15:09.242
If we can defeat the ghosts,
the kids might enjoy that.

00:15:19.961 --> 00:15:22.505
Th-That's...

00:15:22.713 --> 00:15:25.716
The four generals of the Hundred Demons!

00:15:25.925 --> 00:15:31.472
And behind them... is the Great Yokai King!

00:15:31.681 --> 00:15:35.143
He's already been
brought back to this realm?!

00:15:35.351 --> 00:15:37.228
Foolish humans...

00:15:37.437 --> 00:15:40.815
They are the four generals
of the Hundred Demons.

00:15:41.023 --> 00:15:45.361
They will cast you all into
the deepest depths of despair.

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:47.447
W-We're done for...

00:15:47.655 --> 00:15:49.407
I'm sorry for dragging you into this...

00:15:49.615 --> 00:15:53.035
Well, if we're in that much trouble,
let's make a break for it.

00:15:53.244 --> 00:15:54.579
I don't think that's possible, actually.

00:15:54.787 --> 00:15:58.749
True. I don't think I have enough
creativity to design that...

00:16:31.365 --> 00:16:36.204
They took two down instantly?
Just who are those two?

00:16:36.412 --> 00:16:38.581
They're psychics.

00:16:38.789 --> 00:16:43.336
Incredible power like that
exists in this world...?

00:16:43.544 --> 00:16:45.463
I'm so envious.

00:16:48.466 --> 00:16:50.218
You'd think it's worth
being envious of, right?

00:16:50.426 --> 00:16:55.097
But to them, apparently,
it's not incredible at all.

00:16:59.644 --> 00:17:01.646
Not only have you defeated
my Hundred Demons,

00:17:01.854 --> 00:17:03.898
you've defeated my four generals...

00:17:04.106 --> 00:17:07.235
Not bad, humans...

00:17:07.443 --> 00:17:09.820
But...

00:17:14.075 --> 00:17:16.494
...don't believe for a second...

00:17:16.702 --> 00:17:19.997
...that you can defeat the Great Yokai King!

00:17:21.207 --> 00:17:24.377
Y-You two are so powerful...

00:17:24.585 --> 00:17:27.838
Any interest in becoming Yokai hunters?

00:17:28.047 --> 00:17:30.633
Of course, I'll make sure
you're paid every month.

00:17:30.841 --> 00:17:32.927
What?! Hey, you two--

00:17:33.135 --> 00:17:35.930
Yeah, I don't think so. I want to study.

00:17:36.138 --> 00:17:37.056
I'm sorry.

00:17:37.265 --> 00:17:40.476
My head is currently full of thoughts
concerning the cultural fair.

00:17:40.685 --> 00:17:41.769
Cultural fair...?

00:17:41.978 --> 00:17:44.480
Heh. Too bad for you.

00:17:44.689 --> 00:17:47.775
They're too busy trying
to live their daily lives.

00:17:47.984 --> 00:17:49.026
Amakusa...

00:17:49.235 --> 00:17:52.613
If you think you can use
your money to win over everyone,

00:17:52.822 --> 00:17:54.991
you're gravely mistaken!

00:17:56.158 --> 00:17:57.660
Reigen, my apologies!

00:17:57.868 --> 00:18:01.747
You believed what I had to say as a friend,

00:18:01.956 --> 00:18:05.084
and yet, I tried to buy
your help with money!

00:18:05.293 --> 00:18:07.670
Please forgive my foolishness!

00:18:07.878 --> 00:18:09.130
Er, hey, wait!

00:18:09.338 --> 00:18:12.717
I'm absolutely okay with
getting a consultation fee--

00:18:14.927 --> 00:18:18.806
I-I see. I'm glad you understand.

00:18:19.015 --> 00:18:22.518
Reigen... I thank you from
the bottom of my heart.

00:18:23.603 --> 00:18:26.981
You know, this is a rather freaky design.

00:18:27.189 --> 00:18:30.901
I wonder if I could stuff this and sell it...

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:32.069
Huh?

00:18:32.278 --> 00:18:34.488
Well, it is an ayakashi.

00:18:34.697 --> 00:18:36.949
It will eventually turn into ash.

00:18:37.158 --> 00:18:38.743
Oh, really.

00:18:40.244 --> 00:18:41.787
That's it!

00:18:43.205 --> 00:18:47.627
That guy was a real Yokai hunter, huh?

00:18:47.835 --> 00:18:50.379
I guess there are all kinds
of jobs in the world.

00:18:50.588 --> 00:18:52.506
Why don't we grab some ramen and head home?

00:18:52.715 --> 00:18:55.259
Oh, I actually have something to do.

00:18:55.468 --> 00:18:58.929
Hm? Wait, what did you want to talk about?

00:18:59.138 --> 00:19:02.183
It's okay. I figured it out.

00:19:02.391 --> 00:19:04.018
Please excuse me.

00:19:05.978 --> 00:19:09.982
Mob solved something on his own...

00:19:12.401 --> 00:19:13.527
Inukawa-kun.

00:19:13.736 --> 00:19:16.197
I got an idea for the costumes,

00:19:16.405 --> 00:19:19.116
so could you come to class
early tomorrow morning?

00:19:19.325 --> 00:19:23.162
Huh?! Didn't we decide
on the white sheets?

00:19:23.371 --> 00:19:25.956
No. We need to do everything we can.

