00:21:36.045 --> 00:21:39.048
"The Great Yokai King" "The leader of the evil Yokai horde
known as the "Hundred Demons." It has red eyes and sharp fangs.”

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:41.550
There was a blue light shining

00:21:41.759 --> 00:21:44.011
I'm wide awake this 1:30 AM

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:46.639
What remained even after I swiped

00:21:46.847 --> 00:21:50.476
Are the smiles of my friends right beside me

00:21:59.485 --> 00:22:01.695
Yes, I want someone to understand...

00:22:01.904 --> 00:22:04.240
This wish that's hidden colorless and invisible

00:22:04.448 --> 00:22:06.784
The breath I was holding deep within my heart

00:22:06.992 --> 00:22:09.453
I let it all out at once and return to my senses

00:22:09.662 --> 00:22:11.831
On days that I'm feeling apathetic
it suddenly comes to mind

00:22:12.039 --> 00:22:14.375
These seasons I spent as if they were a given

00:22:14.583 --> 00:22:16.877
Even if reality becomes sullied

00:22:17.086 --> 00:22:20.130
Only the sky we saw together is real

00:22:20.339 --> 00:22:22.258
This is more incomprehensible

00:22:22.466 --> 00:22:24.510
Than the grammar on the blackboard

00:22:24.718 --> 00:22:26.929
If it's going to disappear within 24 hours

00:22:27.137 --> 00:22:29.807
This flowing story is just too lonely

00:22:30.015 --> 00:22:31.725
I just can't do it

00:22:31.934 --> 00:22:33.936
Just like that back hip circle I gave up on

00:22:34.144 --> 00:22:36.438
But I'm not going to...

00:22:36.647 --> 00:22:37.982
Give up

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:39.775
My present anymore

00:22:39.984 --> 00:22:42.194
I adorn my overflowing emotions

00:22:42.403 --> 00:22:44.738
And run through my worries and hesitations

00:22:44.947 --> 00:22:47.241
It can't be decided from 0 to 100

00:22:47.449 --> 00:22:49.785
Draw the incomplete future with this hand

00:22:49.994 --> 00:22:52.246
We can't even prove its existence

00:22:52.454 --> 00:22:55.416
But as the world stabs the middle of my chest

00:22:55.624 --> 00:22:58.752
It overflows with cobalt blue

